<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer" />
    <meta
      http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy"
      content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:"
    />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{{ title }}</title>
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        max-width: 760px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 24px;
        color: #111827;
        font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.65;
      }
      .feedback { margin-bottom: 32px; }
      .feedback + .feedback { break-before: page; page-break-before: always; }
      h1 { margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 20px; }
      h2 { margin: 16px 0 4px; font-size: 15px; }
      .meta { margin-top: 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; }
      .score-line { margin: 12px 0; font-size: 18px; }
      .level { margin-left: 8px; color: #1d4ed8; font-size: 15px; }
      .level-desc { color: #334155; font-size: 14px; }
      .warning {
        padding: 8px;
        border: 1px solid #fde68a;
        background: #fffbeb;
        color: #92400e;
        font-size: 13px;
      }
      table { width: 100%; margin-top: 12px; border-collapse: collapse; }
      th, td {
        padding: 8px 6px;
        border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        text-align: left;
        vertical-align: top;
      }
      th { color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; }
      td:first-child, td:nth-child(2) { white-space: nowrap; }
      .no-print { color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; }
      @media print {
        body { max-width: none; padding: 0; }
        .no-print { display: none; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p class="no-print">
      브라우저 인쇄에서 피디에프로 저장을 고르면 학생마다 새 쪽으로 나뉜 파일이 됩니다.
    </p>
    {% for block in blocks %}{{ block|safe }}{% endfor %}
  </body>
</html>
